OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged after pedestrian
OL,4,Akilled in road collision
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have charged a 34-year-old man
OL,7,Fwith death by careless driving after a
OL,8,Fpedestrian was killed on Friday.
OL,10,FA woman in her sixties died following
OL,11,Fthe road traffic collision in
OL,12,FAghagallon, County Antrim.
OL,14,FEmergency services attended but the
OL,15,Fwoman was pronounced dead at the scene.
OL,17,FThe man is due to appear before Lisburn
OL,18,FMagistrates' Court on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
